---
import { Globe, Heart } from '@lucide/astro';
import Github from './icons/Github.astro';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#070a12] text-slate-400">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-cyan-400 p-[1.5px]">
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-[#090d16] rounded-[7px] flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-black text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-400 to-cyan-400 text-base">Z</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
            Zetesis<span class="text-indigo-400 font-light">AI</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          源自希腊语 ζήτησις（探求、求索）。Zetesis AI 专注于探索新一代智能体协调架构、代码智能与开放评估生态系统。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/ZetesisAI"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="GitHub"
            class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <Github class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://zetesisai.github.io"
            aria-label="Official Website"
            class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <Globe class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation Links -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">网站导航</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">主页</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/projects" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">项目矩阵</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">动态与研究</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">关于团队</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Resources & Community -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 tracking-wider uppercase">资源与社区</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/ZetesisAI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
              GitHub 组织
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/ZetesisAI/zetesisai.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
              官网开源仓库
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors">
              站点地图 (Sitemap)
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>© {currentYear} Zetesis AI. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
        Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 underline">Astro</a>
        & deployed on GitHub Pages.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
